- Congratulations! You have reached the FINAL room!!

  The exit is just around the corner ...

## Section: The Exit Exam

To pass this room:
---------------------------------------------------------------------

- This room tests your knowledge of the top Linux commands.
- You will be asked 5 random questions about commands, symbols,
  directories, and operators.
- Answer all 5 correctly to escape!

- Execute the `getKey.sh` to start the quiz.
  - The quiz selects random questions each time.
  - Answer all correctly and you will get the final password.

Good Luck !!!
